# Citation metadata for this repository (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# GitHub renders this file in the "Cite this repository" menu.
# Update `preferred-citation` with the arXiv identifier and, later, the
# journal DOI once they are assigned.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or data, please cite both the repository and the
  paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-10"
title: "LAFT: LLM-Assisted Fortran Translation"
abstract: >-
  An agentic framework for translating legacy Fortran atmospheric physics
  parameterizations into GPU-accelerated JAX, with automated translation,
  error repair, validation against the Fortran reference, and hardware-level
  profiling. This repository holds the framework and the Kessler warm-rain
  microphysics case study with four large language models.
